                {
                    "name": "Presign Asset Download",
                    "request": {
                        "description": "Returns a temporary GET URL for preview or download. Requires login.\n\nFor displaying an image, prefer asset-content: it needs no prior call and its URL never expires.",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
                            }
                        ],
                        "method": "GET",
                        "url": {
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "asset-presign",
                                "{{asset_token}}"
                            ],
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/asset-presign/{{asset_token}}"
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Get Asset Content",
                    "request": {
                        "description": "Redirects (302) to the object in storage, with a signature rebuilt on every request. Meant to be used directly as an image source:\n\n    \u003cimg src=\"/api/asset-content/{assetToken}\"\u003e\n\nThe URL is stable and never expires — only the redirect target does, and that is regenerated each time. No presign call is needed beforehand and nothing has to be refreshed.\n\nNO Authorization header: an \u003cimg\u003e tag cannot send one, so the asset token itself is the credential. Anyone holding the UUID can read the image. Use asset-presign instead when you need the signed URL itself, for example to download it.\n\nResponds 400 when the asset is not uploaded yet, and 404 when it no longer exists.",
                        "header": [],
                        "method": "GET",
                        "url": {
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "asset-content",
                                "{{asset_token}}"
                            ],
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/asset-content/{{asset_token}}"
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Delete Asset",
                    "request": {
                        "description": "Deletes the object from storage when uploaded, then soft-deletes the asset metadata.",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
                            }
                        ],
                        "method": "DELETE",
                        "url": {
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "asset-delete",
                                "{{asset_token}}"
                            ],
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/asset-delete/{{asset_token}}"
                        }
                    }
                }
            ],
            "name": "Asset"
        },
